  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 916875898}
  teacherName: Brito
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1256853252}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1682790333}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  initalLines:
  - "\xA1Hola! \xBFC\xF3mo est\xE1s?"
  - Hispanic culture is so diverse and beautiful.
  - I love traveling to different countries to learn about the culture and eat la
    comida! There are so many different stories influenced by local culture and events.
  - "La Llorona, or The Weeping Woman, is a popular story in M\xE9xico about a woman
    who lurks in water, mourning her children she drowned after her lover left."
  - "A story of love and tragedy \xBFqu\xE9 triste, no? Let\u2019s see if you can
    beat the strength of someone who lost everything."
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - "You\u2019re stronger than you let on."
  - "Let\u2019s see if you\u2019re stronger than me."
  afterBattleLines:
  - "You\u2019ll do greater things from here."
  afterSpellLines:
  - "\xA1Tenga un buen d\xEDa y buena suerte!"
